          "exampleEs": "SI NO PARAS",
          "explanationEn": "Si introduces a genuinely possible condition, and paras uses the ordinary present form for one familiar listener; no negates that action between them."
        },
        {
          "id": "es-xkcd-diapositivas:narration:app-stop-doing",
          "cardId": "grammar-parar-de-infinitive",
